@local/dsh-ask-mode README · 安装：然后编辑 `$profile\package.json`，合并以下字段（已存在的字段里追加即可）：

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@local/dsh-ask-mode": "link:C:/Users/you/code/dsh-ask-mode"
  },

</details>

两种方式完成后都需**重启 DeepSeek Harness**，并在「插件管理」页确认 `@local/dsh-ask-mode` 已启用。

@local/dsh-ask-mode README · Installation：New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force "$profile\node_modules\@local" | Out-Null

Then merge these fields into `$profile\package.json` (append inside existing fields):

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@local/dsh-ask-mode": "link:C:/Users/you/code/dsh-ask-mode"
  },

</details>

Either way, **restart DeepSeek Harness** afterwards and confirm `@local/dsh-ask-mode` is enabled on the plugin management page.

@local/dsh-ask-mode README · Uninstall：- `host.js` (Node side): owns the mode state and the fence — dynamically adds/removes tools, flips the sandbox to read-only, provides the `save_artifact` tool, and serves the `/ask-mode` route.
- `client.js` (browser side): renders the badge only (preferring the projection hook from the slot host, falling back to polling `/ask-mode`). All restrictions are enforced host-side.

</details>
